{A.A.1 = 1-5}
A.A.1.	Righteous lord who determines destiny! Born to @wDN{Ninlil}, 
A.A.2.	@wDN{Suen}, beloved son of @wDN{Ninlil}, @wDN{Suen}, 
A.A.3.	having no rival in the @wTN{E-kur}, 
A.A.4.	the house of @wDN{Enlil}: 
A.A.5.	your divine powers are majestic divine powers granted by @wDN{An}! 

{A.A.6 = 6-12}
A.A.6.	Your father, holy @wDN{An}, has bestowed upon you divine powers to which other gods cannot aspire. 
A.A.7.	@wDN{Enlil} has decreed them to you in destiny. 
A.A.8.	The lord of the holy lustration rites, @wDN{An}, has established them. 
A.A.9.	……, sacred lion of the gods, 
A.A.10.	justly honoured, 
A.A.11.	you are the light of heaven. 
